    "conversations": [
      {
        "id": "mai",
        "lines": [
          "MaiChào buổi sáng! Pull",
          "MaiAh, cà phê and old facades — mời bạn ngồi! From here stroll Lê Lợi to Nguyễn Huệ for City Hall and the Opera House, then Đồng Khởi to Nhà thờ Đức Bà and the Post Office. Cà phê sữa đá in hand makes the details sweeter, phải không?"
        ],
        "source": "Live NPC conversation"
      },
      {
        "id": "alex",
        "lines": [
          "AlexChào buổi sáng! Beautiful light on the Opera House today, right? Look at how the morning sun hits those columns — what detail catches your eye first?",
          "AlexNice combo! Notice the arched windows and carved trim on the Opera House façade. Then wander Đồng Khởi shops for a cà phê sữa đá — xin mời!"
        ],
        "source": "Live NPC conversation"
      }
    ]
